 "remarks": "Town list 3 beds, 2.5 baths however this exceptional 4-bedroom, 4-full-bath home offering generous living space and a versatile layout. The spacious primary suite features two walk in closets and a private bath. A junior suite with a walk-in closet and its own full bath. In addition, the separate in-law-style setup with two bedrooms and a full bath provides added flexibility for extended living or home office. Step outside to your own private retreat, complete with an in-ground pool, playground, and beautiful natural surroundings. Two driveways and a circular turnaround offer plenty of parking and easy access to both sides of the home. The roof, HVAC, hardwood floors, windows and much more completed within the last 4 years. Tucked away in a peaceful suburban setting with convenient access to NYC and Downtown Greenwich, this home delivers space, privacy, and endless possibilities.",
